xmodel/codex-eval-20260812.md:2960:ZHEGLOV-SCOPE.md:30:**R4. String-equation correspondence for NON-coprime orders (S5, esp. T:one-to-one-correspondence & inverse, 2620–2790).** Extends A. Schwarz's coprime-order bijection; needed precisely because subrectangular DC-pairs have non-coprime orders. Feeds R:distinguished_coefficient (distinguished coefficient =0, via Newton–Puiseux + Wilson, rank-1). Formal-series existence/uniqueness/normalization arguments; the whole transport of the DC-pair to the Puiseux-series side rests here.
