|---|---|---|---|
| R1 l̃=d̃ (l̃=2..6, A=2..4) | (N) unsolvable | 80/80 pass | 80/80 pass |
| R2 l̃>d̃, d̃∤l̃ (12 pairs to (8,5)) | (N) unsolvable | 80/80 pass | 80/80 pass |
| R3 l̃<d̃ (12 pairs to (5,7)) | (N) unsolvable | 80/80 pass | 80/80 pass |
