  3305	{\it Step} 6. Returning to the operator $\tilde{Q}_{N,I}$, we see that the homogeneous component $(\tilde{Q}_{N,I})_{\ord Q_{N,I}-N-1}$ 
  3306	includes a summand from the tail. This  summand from the tail is the highest order homogeneous component of the "monomial" above of $Sdeg_A=1$, and it can be calculated: 
  3307	
  3308	\begin{lemma}
  3309	\label{L:tail}
  3310	The tail component of the term $(\tilde{Q}_{N,I})_{\ord Q_{N,I}-N-1}$ is
  3311	$$
  3312	\epsilon_I(-dn+ln)(\Gamma_1/\tilde{p}-\tilde{u}+c_0)\partial^{\ord ({Q}_{N,I})-1-N},
