   931	\begin{lemma}{(\cite[Lem. 2.12]{GZ1})}
   932	\label{L:total_B}
   933	The subset of totally free of $B_j$ elements from $Hcpc(k)$ for a fixed $k$ form a subring in $\hat{D}_1^{sym}\hat{\otimes}_K\tilde{K}$. 
