  1145	\ref{L:conjugation in E_q} or $W'':=F''\cdot S\subset K((\tilde{D}^{-1}))$, where $F''=K[\tilde{D}]$ if $S\in K^{\oplus q}((\tilde{D}^{-1}))$ (for algebraically closed $K$ $F'=F''$). 
