  2847	f_{0,1}(P)=(1+\alpha x)^{ln}y^{dn}, \quad f_{0,1}(Q)=(1+\alpha x)^{lm}y^{dm},\quad 1<l<d, \quad (m,n)=1, \quad \epsilon (\varphi)\notin \dn .
