  2928	where $Q_{N,i}=F_i(\Phi_{N,1}(P_n),\Phi_{N,1}(Q_n))$ for $i=0, \ldots ,I$ (i.e. the polynomials $F_i$ for $i<I+1$ are the same as polynomials for $P, Q$) such that  $SeqGCD_{I+1}(\Phi_{N,1}(P_n),\Phi_{N,1}(Q_n))=1$, $SeqGCD_{I}(\Phi_{N,1}(P_n),\Phi_{N,1}(Q_n))>1$ and 
